eserves (mission restrictions)" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><profiles><profile id="05493890-d592-4327" name="Standard Reserves" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Select only when the mission allows this formation and it fits the Reserves points cap; normal later-round timing applies. This is not an automatic Deep Strike grant.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="a485ae7a-8b6c-413a" name="Deep Strike — ordinary permitted arrival" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><profiles><profile id="b6ebd6be-36bb-46c6" name="Deep Strike" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use the existing Terminator Teleportarium or printed jump-pack deployment rule where applicable; DOES NOT override normal Reserves caps, distance or arrival timing.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d1fdf34d-19b0-469b" name="Embarked in: Storm Eagle Assault Gunship" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="2f1c-4deb-6384-542d" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><profiles><profile id="8fe61ab6-e424-4266" name="Transport declaration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">START EMBARKED in a separately purchased Storm Eagle Assault Gunship. Formation is 9 infantry model(s); minimum passenger spaces 18. Add attached character passenger spaces separately. A vehicle cannot be assigned more passengers than its printed capacity. This selector does not automatically bind to a specific vehicle instance or validate multiple squads combined in one carrier.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="cc2641dd-74eb-474e" name="Embarked in: Thunderhawk Gunship" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="2590-7f88-3edf-5c1a" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><profiles><profile id="55d94c88-db17-4eff" name="Transport declaration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">START EMBARKED in a separately purchased Thunderhawk Gunship. Formation is 9 infantry model(s); minimum passenger spaces 18. Add attached character passenger spaces separately. A vehicle cannot be assigned more passengers than its printed capacity. This selector does not automatically bind to a specific vehicle instance or validate multiple squads combined in one carrier.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="f02c2322-6ea1-4e34" name="Embarked in: Stormbird Heavy Assault Ship" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId