1-0d90-3b92-5cec">START EMBARKED in a separately purchased Mastodon Heavy Transport. Formation is 5 infantry model(s); minimum passenger spaces 10. Add attached character passenger spaces separately. A vehicle cannot be assigned more passengers than its printed capacity. This selector does not automatically bind to a specific vehicle instance or validate multiple squads combined in one carrier.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups><profiles><profile id="6641553b-429e-4ff0-badb-356cea9b0626" name="Preset — Flame Breachers" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Preselected at muster, but each model/equipment group remains editable. No extra point cost. Champion 1: Storm bolter, chainfist; Warrior 5: Heavy flamer, power maul. All equipment restrictions and the original unit ability still apply.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="76b9-d43c-1239-5fba" name="6 models" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="235.0"/></costs><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="d2848d70-de85-417a" name="Champion 1 — choose exact wargear" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="cfe37089-d401-47f7"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="616912ce-c4ab-4f78" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="9a7eac5c-babc-4d63" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="cfe37089-d401-47f7" name="Storm bolter, power maul" hidden="false" collective="false" ty