ard Reserves" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Select only when the mission allows this formation and it fits the Reserves points cap; normal later-round timing applies. This is not an automatic Deep Strike grant.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="541b3ebb-21b4-441d" name="Deep Strike — ordinary permitted arrival" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><profiles><profile id="f6cdd898-a243-4235" name="Deep Strike" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use the existing Terminator Teleportarium or printed jump-pack deployment rule where applicable; DOES NOT override normal Reserves caps, distance or arrival timing.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="799af8d0-e369-4afd" name="Embarked in: Land Raider" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="b61d-137f-cbfd-594d" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><profiles><profile id="f618217a-45c2-4252" name="Transport declaration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">START EMBARKED in a separately purchased Land Raider. Formation is 6 infantry model(s); minimum passenger spaces 12. Add attached character passenger spaces separately. A vehicle cannot be assigned more passengers than its printed