applies. This is not an automatic Deep Strike grant.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="91ec0de6-8f09-4de6" name="Cohort Insertion — First-turn Deep Strike" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><profiles><profile id="04dfb32e-5f2c-4fc0" name="Cohort Insertion" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Entire Chaplain-led formation (bundled in the selected unit size) deploys independently by Deep Strike, including the approved FIRST FRIENDLY Reinforcements step if the first-turn option was chosen. This waives ONLY first-round arrival prohibition, not Reserves cap, coherency or enemy exclusion. No transport may gain early arrival by carrying this unit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="9d94d04f-b932-4ff2" name="Cohort Insertion — Later-round Deep Strike" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><profiles><profile id="b2ca439c-e86d-4938" name="Cohort Insertion" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Entire Chaplain-led formation (bundled in the selected unit size) deploys independently by Deep Strike, including the approved FIRST FRIENDLY Reinforcements step if the first-turn option was chosen. This waives ONLY first-round arrival prohibition, not Reserves cap, coherency or enemy exclusion. No transport may gain early arrival by carrying this unit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="9e0aa31e-0b77-468d" name="Embarked in: Rhino Carrier" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="7a6c-99a9-6f03-5c81" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><profiles><profile id="04d9be38-3d0a-4255" name="Transport declaration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">START EMBARKED in a separately purchased Rhino Carrier. Formation is 7 infantry model(s) plus its mandatory PAID Chaplain; minimum passenger spaces 8. Add attached character passenger spaces separately. A vehicle cannot be assigned more passengers than its printed capacity. This selector does not automatically bind to a specific vehicle instance or validate multiple squads combined in one carrier.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="af313f64-7e82-4d75" name="Embarked in: Land Raider" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="b61d-137f-cbfd-594d" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><profiles><profile id="dfd2bc1c-05e6-4c43" name="Transport declaration" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">START EMBARKED in a separately purchased Land Raider. Formation is 7 infantry model(s) plus its mandatory PAID Chaplain; minimum passenger spaces 8. Add attached character passenger spaces separately. A vehicle cannot be assigned more passengers than its prin