 &amp; Unit Upgrades — choose at most ONE" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="303b89dc-6dc5-4486" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></constraints><entryLinks><entryLink id="ca480163-80e9-4938" name="Pattern Reliquary (+20 pts)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="selectionEntry" targetId="3d76ca65-fda8-441c"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="5856-87a6-b30e-596e" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="36712d52-c458-4698" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers></entryLink></entryLinks></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="0.0"/></costs><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="860b-b251-3c96-5f0d" value="2"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="b5e1b5c6-826e-48dd" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="d998-4f35-d936-58a5" name="Contemptor Relic Dreadnought" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="bd4f-ad45-4725-5892" name="Dreadnoughts" hidden="false" targetId="930f-f4e6-1451-52ba" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="f795-83eb-90e0-580b" type="max"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="7251-3b14-aa85-5c12" name="Contemptor Relic Dreadnought" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">8"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">9</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">3</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f562-4423-700b-5dbc" name="Relic Pilot" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Pilot Resilience: once per battle round re-roll a failed saving throw against an attack with Damage 1; the chassis does not heal via serum.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="812b-a891-3a08-5223" name="Wargear / legal alternatives" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Kheres assault cannon and power claw. May replace cannon with twin lascannons. Hull does not receive serum; surviving pilot uses separate Pilot Resilience once per round against Damage 1.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="0b36-2b19-147e-5aa8" name="Unit rule / battlefield role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Does not receive Infernal Serum. Pilot Resilience: once per battle round may re-roll failed save against a Damage 1 attack; no hull regeneration. Fully accurate core interactions require human oversight; this is homebrew.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d9a4fbac-e6ed-4037-a8c4-2c9fb4efbf6f" name="ROSTER CARD — Configuration Guide" hidden="true" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: Kheres assault cannon and power claw. May replace cannon with twin lascannons. Hull does not receive serum; surviving pilot uses separate Pilot Resilience once per round against Damage 1. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="3db061fb-0221-54a6" name="Pilot Resilience" hidden="false" targetId="595a068d-663b-51e6" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="165.0"/></costs><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="6fc4ae50-0bd1-4987" name="Main gun" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="2da51cc3-58eb-4dcc"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="c6d032d1-dd21-444a" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="e188ad90-76f6-4385" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="2da51cc3-58eb-4dcc" name="Kheres assault cannon" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="1b48c746-7814-4ae3" name="Kheres assault cannon" hidden="false" targetId="6f00-dda6-7046-58cb" type="profile"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="fc4299f8-4060-411d" name="Twin lascannons" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="293b0934-0dd5-4e07" name="Twin lascannons" hidden="false" targetId="50ca-22a4-36c4-5a73" type="profile"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="2d503959-d8e0-4bbf" name="Melee weapon" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="17310f1e-45c4-47f0"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="c8bda8ba-b025-481d" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="7e7279b8-074c-42e3" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="17310f1e-45c4-47f0" name="Power claw" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="36ac40ad-3589-479a" name="Power claw" hidden="false" targetId="6553-72c8-a211-5dd7" type="profile"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="c409f829-8ec5-44fb" name="Enhancements &amp; Unit Upgrades — choose at most ONE" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="be9bc4e7-3523-428d" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></constraints><entryLinks><entryLink id="59c9474d-1a62-4cf2" name="Ash-Forged Targeter (+10 pts)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="selectionEntry" targetId="46d64132-8587-4978"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="5856-87a6-b30e-596e" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true"><conditions><condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="f8ae55e3-f520-4e97" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers></entryLink></entryLinks></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="f795-83eb-90e0-580b" value="2"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="b5e1b5c6-826e-48dd" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="2425-a086-42d1-5f98" name="Leviathan Siege Dreadnought" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="0378-f15e-a9b5-5605" name="Dreadnoughts" hidden="false" targetId="930f-f4e6-1451-52ba" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="63b8-16d2-d611-5d9c" type="max"/></constraints><profiles><profile id="5731-ec13-6052-5a5e" name="Leviathan Siege Dreadnought" hidden="false" typeId="0cb1-7394-fb88-5322" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="8ffa-8367-2184-5557">6"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="c2bc-ad63-c63b-5cea">11</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="f078-5176-43c6-5f6a">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="ecdc-11e1-15d1-5780">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="2bb6-cceb-9d3f-5f47">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="6bb9-f7e0-3ec4-5517">4</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="0031-2800-e5b2-5070" name="Siege Machine" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Re-roll one Wound roll against Fortifications or Vehicles. Eligible living pilot has Pilot Resilience, NOT hull regeneration.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3aad-b0e5-b321-5c21" name="Wargear / legal alternatives" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Cyclonic melta lance and siege claw; may exchange melta lance for siege cannon, or claw for secondary heavy flamer [provisional]. Pilot Resilience only; hull does not regenerate.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="20ef-6fd6-879a-5c08" name="Unit rule / battlefield role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Does not receive Infernal Serum. Pilot Resilience: once per battle round may re-roll failed save against a Damage 1 attack; no hull regeneration. Fully accurate core interactions require human oversight; this is homebrew.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e5a7f1b7-9c75-4d02-b7fb-7c9a686a5dcc" name="ROSTER CARD — Configuration Guide" hidden="true" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: Cyclonic melta lance and siege claw; may exchange melta lance for siege cannon, or claw for secondary heavy flamer [provisional]. Pilot Resilience only; hull does not regenerate. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="2183bf6a-6997-5449" name="Pilot Resilience" hidden="false" targetId="595a068d-663b-51e6" type="rule"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="245.0"/></costs><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="9c0f6545-f0d8-4f60" name="Main arm" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="24e450e4-95c3-454a"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="35531564-e5b8-4c50" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="bf52aedd-5a7a-403d" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="24e450e4-95c3-454a" name="Cyclonic melta lance" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="2ac2f734-5b14-494b" name="Cyclonic melta lance" hidden="false" targetId="c513-9804-562f-555d" type="profile"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="f02d46e2-6f1f-46f1" name="Siege cannon" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="7a1ba52a-1c10-4917" name="Siege cannon" hidden="false" targetId="9e38-80f5-c51a-52de" type="profile"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="c0ce4515-4955-4a77" name="Secondary arm" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="962e554a-fc7d-4b34"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="1846953a-8ec3-4ffd" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="104cd6df-1137-49d1" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="962e554a-fc7d-4b34" name="Siege claw" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="c114e1d9-cfb5-43ce" name="Siege claw" hidden="false" targetId="7dc8-0a11-