bi-bolter. Capacity 12 Infantry spaces, Terminator takes 2; no mounted, jump-pack or daemon passengers.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="53cd-e0de-d318-5bcf" name="Unit rule / battlefield role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Does not receive Infernal Serum. Fully accurate core interactions require human oversight; this is homebrew.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="1ddf8cff-8e0b-454e" name="Passenger Manifest &amp; capacity" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Transport registration: Passenger-bearing Infantry must DECLARE this vehicle type in their Deployment / passenger assignment selection. Capacity 12 spaces; Terminators and jump-equipped passengers may use two each where permitted. Include ALL attached leaders and all squads sharing a carrier; do not exceed capacity. The catalogue records carrier TYPE, not a unique vehicle instance, so this capacity total must still be checked before play.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5d5f4815-addc-4ba2" name="Legion Assault Requisition conditions" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">OPTIONAL discounted transport under Breach and Ruin: saves 35 points once per eligible hull, with 1 discount per full 1,000 army points (max 2). This vehicle must start with a compatible separately purchased infantry formation embarked; not a formation using Void Assault or Cohort Insertion. Real passenger allocation must be confirmed manually.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e0b7697e-f97d-47bf" name="Mechanised Vanguard conditions" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic 