eristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: Choose battle cannon OR volkite cardanelle main gun; sponson heavy bolters or lascannons; optional hull autocannon. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks>
