ec">Neutron laser battery with 2 heavy bolter OR lascannon sponsons. Cannot swap main gun for Typhon cannon.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="1d6c-f715-25bf-52fb" name="Unit rule / battlefield role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Does not receive Infernal Serum. Fully accurate core interactions require human oversight; this is homebrew.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="0acbe664-1ec9-44a3-992f-892bc0345626" name="ROSTER CARD — Configuration Guide" hidden="true" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: Neutron laser battery with 2 heavy bolter OR lascannon sponsons. Cannot swap main gun for Typhon cannon. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks>
