"Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Fellblade accelerator cannon, demolisher cannon, 2 lascannon sponson mounts.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="380a-3cb8-0082-5b12" name="Unit rule / battlefield role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Does not receive Infernal Serum. Fully accurate core interactions require human oversight; this is homebrew.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="aa0e8317-964a-4584-8c17-b7605dedb173" name="ROSTER CARD — Configuration Guide" hidden="true" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: Fellblade accelerator cannon, demolisher cannon, 2 lascannon sponson mounts. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks/><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="540.0"/></costs><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="42bf7ecb-47bb-4ef8" name="Fixed armament" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="ad9fe679-bd35-4973"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="60b653ae-7b2b-488a" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="5ac522a2-d322-4a6b" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ad9fe679-bd35-4973" name=