>2 lascannons and a rotary missile launcher. Aircraft movement/Reserves restrictions apply.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="052c-c7ea-ef69-5422" name="Unit rule / battlefield role" hidden="false" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Does not receive Infernal Serum. Fully accurate core interactions require human oversight; this is homebrew.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c63bee40-e659-42a2-91d1-2b9b1dfa8001" name="ROSTER CARD — Configuration Guide" hidden="true" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: 2 lascannons and a rotary missile launcher. Aircraft movement/Reserves restrictions apply. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks>
