ssignment selection. Capacity 40 spaces; Terminators and jump-equipped passengers may use two each where permitted. Include ALL attached leaders and all squads sharing a carrier; do not exceed capacity. The catalogue records carrier TYPE, not a unique vehicle instance, so this capacity total must still be checked before play.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f63c2d9a-d57d-4337-9c76-b1598115255a" name="ROSTER CARD — Configuration Guide" hidden="true" typeId="bd5c-f804-35b5-510d" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c71-0d90-3b92-5cec">Use selected weapon subentries for the exact equipped models (not every available arsenal option). Wargear / legal alternatives: Heavy lascannon array, bombard batteries and defensive heavy bolters. Carries 40 Infantry spaces; Terminators cost 2. Oversized base may need mission agreement. | The exported roster should include the selected size variant, any Enhancement/Upgrade and the declared deployment method. Leaders are separate paid units unless the Lost Cohort formation includes its compulsory Chaplain in its printed cost.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks/><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="0246-3343-a75c-5ffa" value="680.0"/></costs><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="03842401-6c00-49a0" name="Fixed weapons" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="b967078c-90eb-497e"><constraints><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="163b262d-403d-4008" type="min"/><constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="cc8547fb-fc74-4cd4" type="max"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="b967078c-90eb-497e" name="Heavy lascannon array, bombard batteries, defensive heavy bolters" hidden="